#. SourceLocation:	/Game/DirectorsCut/Data/DT_FarewellLines.DT_FarewellLines.Farewell_Day_01.Text
#: /Game/DirectorsCut/Data/DT_FarewellLines.DT_FarewellLines.Farewell_Day_01.Text
